{
  "name": "Sage Desk (4.9, eval-ready)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Sage Desk (eval-ready)\nLesson 4.9. Your support agent with two entry points: the real Telegram Trigger, and When Executed by Another Workflow for the evaluation harness. After the agent, Check if evaluating sends test runs back to the harness and real conversations to Telegram, so test runs never message customers.\n\nReturn intermediate steps is on, so the harness can check which tools were called.\n\n**Credentials:** Telegram API, OpenAI (model + embeddings), Supabase.\n**Replace:** YOUR_MODEL; YOUR_GET_PRICE_WORKFLOW_ID (pick SUB · Get price).\nAdd your other tools (get_order, issue_refund) as in 4.5 once this works; issue_refund must never run real refunds in evaluation runs.",
        "height": 460,
        "width": 440
      },
      "id": "ce416cbe-eda5-4643-83f5-703f32754f11",
      "name": "Sticky Note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
